msgid "coffee.coverage"
msgstr "About this edition"

msgid "coffee.coverageBody"
msgstr "A curated starting point: 113 records across two species, reviewed against World Coffee Research and Brazil’s Instituto Agronômico. This is not a complete catalog. Liberica, other Coffea species, many regional selections and emerging trade names are not yet covered. Featured labels are editorial choices. Zoom in to see every name."

msgid "coffee.method"
msgstr "Origins refer to documented discovery or selection, not every country of cultivation. Missing or ambiguous origins remain unknown. Evidence filters match any claim in a profile. Genetic groups are not direct parents. Links only represent reviewed relationships; accession names in descriptions are not automatically varieties."

msgid "coffee.updates"
msgstr "Manually maintained, with original summaries and claim-level citations. Sources may change after review; no automatic freshness or completeness is promised."

